    {
      "id": "sp-the-morning-train-leaves",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "The morning train leaves at seven, so if we want a good seat, we really should get there a little early.",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Statement", "pt-BR": "Afirmativa"},
      "tip": "speech",
      "sub": {"en": "Falling, assured intonation at the end", "pt-BR": "Entoação descendente e segura no fim"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-did-you-really-think",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Did you really think I would forget about tonight, after everything we planned together for the last three months?",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Question ↗", "pt-BR": "Pergunta ↗"},
      "tip": "question",
      "sub": {
        "en": "Yes/no question: the melody rises at the end",
        "pt-BR": "Pergunta sim/não: a melodia sobe no fim"
      },
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-i-never-said-she",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "I never said she took the money. I said *he* took it, and I can prove it.",
      "dur": 7,
      "emo": {"en": "Emphasis", "pt-BR": "Ênfase"},
      "tip": "emphasis",
      "sub": {"en": "Contrast: all the weight on “he”", "pt-BR": "Contraste: toda a força no “he”"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-every-summer-my-grandfather",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Every summer, my grandfather played old vinyl records on the porch, and the whole street would stop to listen until midnight.",
      "dur": 9,
      "emo": {"en": "Narrative", "pt-BR": "Narrativa"},
      "tip": "speech",
      "sub": {"en": "Storyteller tone, calm pace", "pt-BR": "Tom de contador de histórias, ritmo calmo"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-that-was-the-best",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "That was the best show we have ever played! Did you hear the crowd singing every single word back at us?",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Exclamation", "pt-BR": "Exclamação"},
      "tip": "emotion",
      "sub": {
        "en": "High energy and a smile in the voice, no shouting",
        "pt-BR": "Energia alta e sorriso na voz, sem gritar"
      },
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-where-were-you-when",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Where were you when the lights went out across the city, and why didn’t you answer any of my calls?",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Question ↘", "pt-BR": "Pergunta ↘"},
      "tip": "question",
      "sub": {
        "en": "Open question (where/why): the melody falls at the end",
        "pt-BR": "Pergunta aberta (where/why): a melodia desce no fim"
      },
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-take-a-slow-breath",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Take a slow breath, relax your shoulders, and let the sound come out on its own. There is no rush at all.",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Calm", "pt-BR": "Calma"},
      "tip": "speech",
      "sub": {"en": "Low, close voice, without whispering", "pt-BR": "Voz baixa e próxima, sem sussurrar"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-it-is-not-about",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "It is not about how *loud* you sing. It is about how *true* it feels when the words finally leave your mouth.",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Emphasis", "pt-BR": "Ênfase"},
      "tip": "emphasis",
      "sub": {"en": "Two stressed words: loud / true", "pt-BR": "Duas palavras em destaque: loud / true"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-hey-it-s-me-i-m",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Hey, it’s me. I’m running a little late because of the traffic, but I promise I’m on my way right now.",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Dialogue · A", "pt-BR": "Diálogo · A"},
      "tip": "speech",
      "sub": {"en": "Voice message to a friend, relaxed", "pt-BR": "Mensagem de voz para um amigo, descontraído"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-no-worries-at-all",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "No worries at all. Grab a coffee, sit down, and we’ll start the session as soon as the engineer arrives.",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Dialogue · B", "pt-BR": "Diálogo · B"},
      "tip": "speech",
      "sub": {"en": "Friendly, reassuring reply", "pt-BR": "Resposta simpática e tranquilizadora"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-could-you-play-that",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Could you play that part again, just a little bit slower this time, so I can find the right harmony?",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Polite request", "pt-BR": "Pedido educado"},
      "tip": "question",
      "sub": {"en": "Gentle request, slight rise at the end", "pt-BR": "Pedido gentil, subida leve no fim"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-wait-you-wrote-this",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Wait, you wrote this whole song in one night? That’s incredible. How did you even come up with that melody?",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Surprise", "pt-BR": "Surpresa"},
      "tip": "emotion",
      "sub": {"en": "Real astonishment in the first sentence", "pt-BR": "Espanto genuíno na primeira frase"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-some-songs-stay-with",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Some songs stay with you long after the people who sang them are gone, like an echo that never fades.",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Melancholy", "pt-BR": "Melancolia"},
      "tip": "emotion",
      "sub": {"en": "Darker, slower voice, without dragging", "pt-BR": "Voz mais escura e lenta, sem arrastar"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-trust-me-once-the",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Trust me, once the chorus kicks in and the drums come back, everybody in the room is going to sing along.",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Confidence", "pt-BR": "Confiança"},
      "tip": "emotion",
      "sub": {"en": "Firm and enthusiastic", "pt-BR": "Firme e entusiasmado"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-turn-the-volume-down",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Turn the volume down, check your levels one more time, and press record only when you feel completely ready.",
      "dur": 7,
      "emo": {"en": "Instruction", "pt-BR": "Instrução"},
      "tip": "speech",
      "sub": {
        "en": "Clear and measured, like a studio engineer",
        "pt-BR": "Claro e pausado, como um técnico de estúdio"
      },
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-i-asked-for-three",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "I asked for *three* takes, not *thirty*. But thank you anyway, a few of them were actually pretty good.",
      "dur": 7,
      "emo": {"en": "Emphasis · humour", "pt-BR": "Ênfase · humor"},
      "tip": "emphasis",
      "sub": {"en": "Light irony, contrast three / thirty", "pt-BR": "Ironia leve, contraste three / thirty"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-what-would-you-do",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "What would you do if you could hear your own voice for the very first time, exactly the way others hear it?",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Open question", "pt-BR": "Pergunta aberta"},
      "tip": "question",
      "sub": {"en": "Curious, reflective pace", "pt-BR": "Curiosidade, ritmo reflexivo"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-okay-okay-i-admit",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Okay, okay, I admit it. That last high note was a little ambitious, but at least nobody fell off their chair.",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Joy", "pt-BR": "Alegria"},
      "tip": "emotion",
      "sub": {"en": "Laughing at yourself, light voice", "pt-BR": "Rindo de si mesmo, voz leve"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-judge-the-size-of",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Judge the size of the box, then quickly move the heavy chairs away from the wall before the guests arrive.",
      "dur": 8,
      "emo": {"en": "Phonetic sentence", "pt-BR": "Frase fonética"},
      "tip": "speech",
      "sub": {"en": "Rich in consonants: dʒ, z, kw, v, tʃ, ð", "pt-BR": "Rica em consoantes: dʒ, z, kw, v, tʃ, ð"},
      "reg": {"en": "Speech · Middle", "pt-BR": "Fala · Médio"}
    },
    {
      "id": "sp-under-the-old-stone",
      "cat": "speech",
      "mode": "speech",
      "text": "Under the old stone bridge, the river turned silver as the sun finally went down behind the hills.",
